{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的S01在19秒内集中出现较多未分时的感受词，扫读负担略大；另外S11、S13个别心理动机不如Y交代得直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮关键词让我能迅速抓住人物每一步的心理变化，小字感受与音乐分时出现，也减少了一堆词同时争夺注意力的问题。反复出现的船、水面、摇荡和停定等意象，让开头的不安、过程中的沉醉与失衡、结尾的安定形成了连续的体验，感受也更有具体的身体和声音层次。Y的心理解释有时更完整直接，尤其是人物为什么愿意陪伴、为什么渴望保证，但整体而言，X更适合一边听音乐一边观看。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "609e4349-7253-4ad8-9a32-82db36be372d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T053058491375Z", "elapsed_seconds": 115.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:32:53.810487+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bbf4655b08ab2c52862ff5b67abe31e83f81e75827af260fc6c9e9a3abc7d620", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp